  "title": "Fondant for Chocolate Cherries",
  "description": "Use this simple, 4-ingredient fondant to wrap maraschino cherries (hint: dry the cherries on paper towels first) before dipping in chocolate. In about 5 days the fondant will liquify inside the chocolate coating, giving you a juicy cordial candy.",
  "authors": [
